# === VELOCITY DAMPING ===
fix damp_t1 type1_particles viscous 1.000000e-04
fix damp_t2 type2_particles viscous 1.000000e-04
fix damp_t3 type3_particles viscous 1.000000e-04
fix damp_t4 type4_particles viscous 1.000000e-04

print 'Magnetic field activated'
print '  - 728 field regions'
print '  - 4 particle types'
print '  - Method: fix addforce with numeric values'
print '==============================================================================='

# === EMERGENCY TEST: APPLY KNOWN FORCE ===
